  "display_title": "The Cutest Little Villainess",
  "description": "Lysian de Neif thought her sad life couldn't get any worse until she discovered she was kidnapped by the woman she called mother and never returned because her real family refused to save her. After learning the secret behind her birth, Lysian dies yet again, only to wake up in the past as her younger self. This time, she decides to go on a journey to find the ones who abandoned her and get revenge. But little does Lysian know that there is more to the truth and her kin than meets the eye… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
